1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:02,360
Ask an AI about a Malaysian rule,

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:04,152
and it answers with confidence.

3
00:00:04,152 --> 00:00:06,920
Sometimes the rule changed years ago.

4
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,200
Here the answer says 6%.

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,448
The customs page says 8%,

6
00:00:11,448 --> 00:00:13,120
from March 2024.

7
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,320
Outdated.

8
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:19,960
Terkini checks those answers against official government pages.

9
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,651
Each claim goes to Tavily Search,

10
00:00:22,651 --> 00:00:24,472
restricted to official domains,

11
00:00:24,472 --> 00:00:27,064
with live results for rules that change.

12
00:00:27,064 --> 00:00:30,400
Then Tavily Extract reads the page itself.

13
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:34,300
Every verdict must quote the page word for word.

14
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,853
Terkini then checks that the quote is really there.

15
00:00:36,853 --> 00:00:37,840
No exact quote,

16
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,160
no verdict.

17
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:41,680
The models run through Bifrost:

18
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:42,760
one virtual key,

19
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,640
a daily budget,

20
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,960
and fallbacks across vendors.

21
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:48,946
We asked 3 models 23 questions.

22
00:00:48,946 --> 00:00:52,100
28 of 68 answers stated a rule that is

23
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,660
no longer current.

24
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:56,320
Terkini flagged 20 answers,

25
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:58,267
and 13 were really stale:

26
00:00:58,267 --> 00:00:59,840
65% precision,

27
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,340
46% recall.

28
00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:03,440
The misses are published too.
